Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:38.72,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Thursday, July 16th.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:44.16,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm never any good at these book questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:45.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&H988B84&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Thursday, July 16th
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:47.85,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I know I should concentrate \Non figuring out the prose and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:51.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,work through the questions without \Ntrying to fully understand them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but I just can't seem to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:02:01.19,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The way people stress over not understanding \Neach other makes no sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:03.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:10.17,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. That just makes me weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:16.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Anyway, Asamura-kun is really \Ngood at explaining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:20.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I had honestly kind of given up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:24.11,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but thanks to him, I have hope again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.30,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&HAFA1B8&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Friday, July 17th
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:31.44,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Friday, July 17th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:35.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The music he recommended is really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:39.54,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun went out of his way \Nto find something good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:41.02,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I should thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:58.66,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:04.84,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,When I get in bed and close my eyes, my head \Nfills with all sorts of annoying thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:11.62,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun got that music from \Nhis pretty senpai at work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:16.84,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters. \NBut if I don't think it matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.59,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,why bother writing about it in my diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&HBBDDD1&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Saturday, July 18th
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:27.72,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't get it. No matter how I look at it,\N it doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:32.11,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I have no right to be\Nwriting things like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:35.11,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,yet I'm doing it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.92,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Who cares? I'm only doing this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:43.10,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun came home late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.63,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Something with a girl from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:49.13,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything to me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:55.84,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure, I know. There's no reason for \Nhim to report stuff like that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:04:01.35,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Was it that same girl, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:06.39,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If so, I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.73,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, when I write it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:16.26,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I feel like the words that come out on \Nthe page don't match my true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:22.40,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But of the words in my vocabulary, \N"hate" is the one that comes closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:27.41,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm so awful. I don't even \Nknow anything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:29.48,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It makes me sick of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.91,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It's self-hatred. I feel so anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:43.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,For some reason, I wanted to welcome\N Asamura-kun home when he got back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:47.61,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,so I decided to study in the living \Nroom instead of my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:55.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn't stay \Nawake until he got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.50,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't get to say "welcome home."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:03.27,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But I did wake up with a blanket on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.16,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I wonder if...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.87,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,When I had that thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:14.58,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,the anxiety I felt last night \Nseemed to clear up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&H89A58D&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Sunday, July 19th
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.83,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Yomiuri Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:21.10,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I think that's a really pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:24.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The kind of name that loves books,\Nis loved by books,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:28.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and is bound to be loved by \Nother people who love books.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:35.95,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Also, maybe it's because she's in \Ncollege, but she seems so mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:39.73,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And she's not just beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:43.23,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,She also has a kind of adorable charm to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:48.09,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I really think they'd make a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:53.94,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If he could be with someone like that, \NI'm sure Asamura-kun would...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnArial\b1\fay-.16\shad0\fs18\c&HC4C9C8&\3c&H232113&\pos(317.891,58.528)}Now Hiring Part-Timers!
