Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnAria\shad0\fs8\fax-.1\c&H676867&\3c&HCDD4D6&\frz6.219\pos(318.858,306.286)}Looking for cheery, energetic individuals.{\c&H000000&} Ask an employee for details.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:01.38,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,A bookstore, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:06.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It isn't exactly an easy, high-paying job,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:09.50,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but instead of trying to take a shortcut,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:12.21,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,maybe it'd be worth it to \Ndo things slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:18.00,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't know, though. \NMaybe it would creep him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:23.28,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I know we're stepsiblings, but interviewing \Nfor a job where your brother works
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.35,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,is kind of a weird thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&H8F8BAE&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Sunday, July 20th
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:30.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Today was my last chance \Nto study before my retest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:35.83,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful to Asamura-kun \Nand Maaya for helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:42.64,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I want to go to bed early and wake up sharp \Nso I can put my brain to work tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:44.14,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,so I'll keep this entry short.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.82,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The sweet 'n' sour pork was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:52.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.99,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I passed my retest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.44,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs12\3c&H444242&\c&HBBB0A7&\b1\pos(386.5,215)}Tuesday, July 21st
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:03.56,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It's easy to say this now \Nthat I have the results,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:08.48,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but honestly, I was already sure by \Nyesterday or so that I was going to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:12.95,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to Asamura-kun. \NAnd Maaya, too. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:18.29,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,At any rate, now I should be able to \Nspend my summer vacation as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnArial\b1\fay-.16\shad0\fs18\c&HC4C9C8&\3c&H232113&\move(317.891,58.528,317.891,68.528)}Now Hiring Part-Timers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnArial\b1\fay-.15\shad0\fs9\c&H6F633E&\3c&HCDD4D6&\move(316.571,155.143,316.571,165.143)}If you're interested in books and publishing, why not come work with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnAria\fay-.12\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HCDD4D6&\move(315.516,171.011,315.516,181.011)}Job Details
