Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,1)\fnAria\shad0\fs8\fax-.1\c&H676867&\3c&HCDD4D6&\frz6.219\move(318.858,306.286,318.858,316.286)}Looking for cheery, energetic individuals.{\c&H000000&} Ask an employee for details.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.06,0:07:23.61,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll keep studying bit by bit \Nas I save up money from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:29.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Someone approached me as I was\N looking at the help wanted poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:34.16,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Without thinking, I told him that,\N yes, I was interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.92,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,No taking it back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:41.53,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I could have practiced \Nfor the interview at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:45.45,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but I figured it'd be really awkward\Nif Asamura-kun were around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.27,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If he saw me, I'd probably die a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:52.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If he asked me why I picked \Nthat bookstore in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.42,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,how would I even answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.08,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I honestly don't know myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.74,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,How could I? There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.44,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:09.38,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I knew I'd be late and thought \Nabout letting you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:15.79,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but then I probably would've \Nhad to explain why I was late,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:19.26,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,so I couldn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:26.56,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, I'm going to have to \Nconfront this anxious feeling I keep getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:33.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,To make up for what I did, I decided \Nto make him a really nice meal tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:39.53,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I figured he'd be more likely to forgive me\Nif I treated him to some good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.66,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And even if he doesn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.44,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,he'll at least have to accept it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:52.67,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll convince him that I was late because \NI stopped by the department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:57.54,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And saying I didn't see his messages \Nbecause my battery died should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:06.06,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The more I lie, the more I feel a seed \Nof doubt starting to sprout in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:12.64,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.97,0:09:20.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,of the feelings I'm having right now. \NI think I have a good idea of what's happening
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:25.26,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and how I'm starting to feel about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:28.67,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,There's only one word to describe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:30.21,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(270,1)\fnArial\shad0\fs18\an8\c&H050C14&\blur2\3c&H5B656A&}...never expected that he attended Suisei, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:32.47,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and I'm torn as to whether \NI should put it down in my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.21,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs18\an8\c&H0C1213&\blur2\3c&H444B51&}...from his pretty senpai...\N...that it really matters...\N...don't think it matters, \Nwhy bother writing about it in my diary?\N...don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:35.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(670,1)\fnArial\shad0\fs18\an8\c&H0C1213&\blur2\3c&H697378&}...like I was thinking about him...\N...I really regret that...\N\NYomiuri Shiori.\N...really pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:37.03,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It's all too ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:42.49,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I never dreamed I'd start behaving \Nlike some character in a novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:51.16,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But I can't run away now. \NThe job interview was such a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:54.84,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to come clean to Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:10:01.45,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm scared to explain it to him. I'm terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:05.95,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But at the same time, \NI think it will be a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:10.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Of course it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:17.01,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, I'll finally be free of this anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:22.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,There are parts of Asamura-kun I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:26.82,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,There are parts of his relationship \Nwith Yomiuri-san I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:31.02,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If I can at least get an idea of what those are,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:37.26,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,maybe this gross, anxious \Nfeeling will let up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I think it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:47.13,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I really can't believe myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:52.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Why am I giving him control over my actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun hasn't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:59.87,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm the one who tied myself in chains
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:02.00,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and bound myself to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:08.43,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Really, the whole thing is so stupid \Nit makes me want to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:15.37,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let anyone read this anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe as a sort of warning to myself, \NI should go ahead and write the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:26.19,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If I hide it way in the back of a drawer \Nand lock it shut, it should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:34.28,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,So here's a test question for you, Ayase Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:43.97,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Describe the nature of the unpleasant \Nfeelings you're experiencing in one word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:47.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,980)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\fs18\blur4\3c&HF8F8F8&\pos(333,165)\c&H5D6059&}Saturday, August 22nd
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:48.75,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,It's all so delicious again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:51.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.91,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Here, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:54.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:59.53,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,So, Yuta and Saki-chan, you both still \Ncall each other by your family names?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:02.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,610)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\an1\bord0\c&HA789E8&\b1\pos(57.714,55.749)}Episode 7 {\fs14}"Feelings and {\c&HCDBD7F&}Summer {\c&HA789E8&}Vacation"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:02.64,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Are you still too embarrassed \Nto use your given names?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:08.90,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Hmm, how about something \Nlike "Big Brother Yuta"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.53,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:11.94,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:12.83,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:14.75,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Do you feel the same, Yuta?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:19.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I agree with Ayase-san. \NIt just doesn't feel right, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:23.13,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, I suppose that's that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:27.14,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Do you both have work again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm planning to leave by noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:36.48,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Are you sure you should be working \Nso much? August is already half over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:40.33,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've still been going \Nto summer cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:43.15,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,No, that's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:49.44,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,It's summer vacation, and it doesn't \Nsound like you've gone anywhere for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.30,0:12:57.66,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,This is a big deal. Once you're a third-year,\Nyou'll have to concentrate on exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.59,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.52,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,And I know you tend to push \Nyourself a bit too hard, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.81,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Your friends are probably \Nmissing you both right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not that many people. \NOh, for me, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san has friends, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We don't have any plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:26.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If you meant Maaya, don't worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.97,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:34.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We're not so close that we'd \Nhang out over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:39.95,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm not mad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:43.46,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But Maaya and I don't really hang \Nout that much to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:45.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Even though she's come over a few times?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:49.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, that's because she was \Nreally curious about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:53.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And also because I invited her,\Nlike last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:59.77,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,She's actually very considerate, so if we \Ndon't make plans, she gives me my space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:00.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:05.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I can kind of understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:08.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't like hanging out with people \NI'm not that close to, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you like your solitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:13.69,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think I do prefer it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:15.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:18.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I guess that's enough talk for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:20.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.63,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:43.10,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,She's sure getting the hang of things quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.49,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is Ayase-san okay over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.13,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Go give her some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:04.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:08.22,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did it show up in the search?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:12.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It says we still have five volumes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:18.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's a new release, right? \NAnd it wasn't on the display stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:19.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\shad0\frz340.3\3c&HE9EDEA&\c&H7F807E&\pos(480,48.133)}Just out on August 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.6\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H324351&\3c&H65D2F2&\b1\pos(313.066,120.134)\frz333.7}T{\fs12}HE {\fs16}B{\fs12}EEHIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.6\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H2B6B87&\3c&H65D2F2&\b1\pos(448,108.934)\frz335.2}T{\fs8}AMURA {\fs10}K{\fs8}ANAE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\shad0\frz350\pos(100,33.2)\c&H193244&\3c&H8FE0F3&}Staff {\c&H7F807E&\3c&HEAEEEC&}Pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.7\fs12\fnArial\shad0\c&HFFEBF6&\3c&HDA80B7&\b1\frz330.9\pos(162.133,212.401)}Town on the Other Side of the Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.6\fs10\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H595061&\3c&HDA80B7&\b1\frz330.2\pos(72,251.334)}Madoka Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fax-.6\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H324351&\3c&H65D2F2&\b1\pos(313.066,120.134)\frz333.7}T{\fs12}HE {\fs16}B{\fs12}EEHIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fax-.6\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H2B6B87&\3c&H65D2F2&\b1\pos(448,108.934)\frz335.2}T{\fs8}AMURA {\fs10}K{\fs8}ANAE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\shad0\frz340.3\3c&HE9EDEA&\c&H7F807E&\pos(480,48.133)}Just out on August 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\shad0\frz350\pos(100,33.2)\c&H193244&\3c&H8FE0F3&}Staff {\c&H7F807E&\3c&HEAEEEC&}Pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.7\fs12\fnArial\shad0\c&HFFEBF6&\3c&HDA80B7&\b1\frz330.9\pos(162.133,212.401)}Town on the Other Side of the Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-.6\fs10\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H595061&\3c&HDA80B7&\b1\frz330.2\pos(72,251.334)}Madoka Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:36.24,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Your customer is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:39.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:48.10,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But really, how did you know? \NIt's like you were psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:53.43,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The sign said that book was a \Nnew release from August 22nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:58.44,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I remembered that the \Nbook on the top of the pile
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:00.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,had already been out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:03.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:07.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I do have a lot more experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.43,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I still think it's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:13.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yomiuri probably would\N have found it even quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:15.88,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:28.94,Main - Top,Saki,0,0,0,,I guess it's already fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:28.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I guess summer isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:30.98,Main - Top,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:30.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:34.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you mean because of this heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:35.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:37.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:41.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That means... it's fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Are you being serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:48.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, they were wearing \Ndifferent clothes until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,They were?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.75,0:16:56.14,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No way. Asamura-kun, are you one of \Nthose people with zero interest in fashion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:59.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen me \Nreading a fashion magazine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:03.00,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:07.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If you're not interested, \NI guess you really wouldn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Looks like you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:17.93,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, I can't imagine you working at \Na clothing boutique, so I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.89,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.28,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs14\3c&H444242&\c&HFFFFFB&\pos(148.348,239.563)}Sunday, August 23rd
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:31.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:36.64,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah. This is our oldest one, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:38.67,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is Ayase-san in her room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:43.54,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, she was until just before you got up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:47.73,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,but she really doesn't \Nhandle the heat very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:49.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:53.28,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It was a real problem when she was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:59.55,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,When summer came, \Nshe'd always demand ice cream
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:02.75,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,and throw tantrums saying, \N"Take me to the pool!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:08.14,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Once she got into middle school, \Nthat started to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.53,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,She became more like she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:18.49,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,She stopped being such a handful, \Nbut I still miss those old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.49,0:18:27.60,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,My mom started working \Ntwice as hard to provide for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:34.25,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.31,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:39.43,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:47.60,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,So anyway, Asamura, I heard you're going \Nto the pool with Narasaka and some people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:57.24,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,What? I'm talking about you and Ayase \Ngoing to the pool with Narasaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:18:59.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Haven't heard a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:01.99,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Didn't you get invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:07.25,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Then maybe they'll invite you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.42,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you short on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:17.71,Default,Maru,0,0,0,,Then we should go. \NLemme hit the bathroom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:18.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:27.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Getting used to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:30.65,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yes. Thanks to your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:34.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're dependable and \Na quick learner, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:35.83,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The other employees were praising you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:39.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:55.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I guess it is like my dad said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Feels like we're spending \Nour whole break working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:00.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:22.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:30.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,By any chance, did Narasaka-san \Ninvite you to go to the pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:36.17,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did she maybe invite me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:41.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Did Maaya tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:45.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, Narasaka-san doesn't have my contact info.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.60,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then how would you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:53.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Someone else told me. \NI hadn't heard anything before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:57.01,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you want to go, Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:59.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:05.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,To be honest, I think I'd feel out of place\Nat a pool with a bunch of cheery people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:06.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Not really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:08.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:17.24,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then you don't need to force yourself to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:20.99,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Aren't you going? To the pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:22.81,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:33.99,Flashback,Saki,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, \NI'm going to be working at your store.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:38.40,Flashback,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you applied for a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.84,Flashback,Saki,0,0,0,,It would've been embarrassing \Nif I didn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:47.41,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(780,1)\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&H98948A&\pos(407.001,150.333)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:57.67,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,So here's a test question \Nfor you, Ayase Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:02.67,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Describe the nature of the unpleasant \Nfeelings you're experiencing in one word.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:08.81,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,"Jealousy."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HA789E8&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 8 {\fs14}"A Response and Hot M{\c&HCDBD7F&}i{\c&HA789E8&}lk"
